   "source": [
    "### Zach Lovas\n",
    "\n",
    "# Finding The Best Neighborhood: Pittsburgh's Parks\n",
    "\n",
    "## The question: Which Pittsburgh neighborhoods have the greatest percentage of land devoted to parks?\n",
    "\n",
    "I deemed **neighborhood parks** would be a great submetric, as parks contribute to a neighborhood's appeal by providing space for recreation, relaxation, and outdoor activities. \n",
    "\n",
    "To identify which Pittsburgh neighborhoods offer the greatest amount of green land, my notebook uses geographic data from the **Western Pennsylvania Regional Data Center (WPRDC)**.\n",
    "\n",
    "Using GeoPandas below, I compared the area occupied by parks with the total area of each neighborhood. **Neighborhoods with a greater percentage of parkland rank higher in the overall search for the best neighborhood!**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8cac5fec-3544-405b-b8c3-cb4c93833ecf",
   "metadata": {},
