    "### Calculating Park Coverage\n",
    "Now, for the *main part...*\n",
    "\n",
    "Instead of examining each neighborhood, I decided to only list the top ten. The final map would be too cluttered!\n",
    "\n",
    "Below, I aligned both the neighborhood and park datasets geographically, found where parks overlap each neighborhood, and calculated what percentage of each neighborhood is parkland.\n",
    "\n",
    "This was as simple as applying:\n",
    "### Park coverage % = (Park area / Neighborhood area) * 100\n",
    "ㅤ"
   ]
  },
